  "material_note": "Sampled per triangle at the MU-UV centres. Island 0 (14) is the long blade, silver at (175, 181, 174): steel. Island 3 (56) is the winged guard on the right of sword14.jpg, bronze-gold at (111, 99, 75), and 4 and 5 (30 each) the side wings beside it, (116, 108, 88): brass, at 0.6 against the ceiling. Islands 1 and 6 are the pommel caps, brass. Island 2 (34) is the grip and the hilt's inner plates, mixed, and stays steel. Islands 7 to 18 are the twelve single-triangle teeth on sword14.tga, cut out by its alpha: steel. Steel at 0.45 as the Legendary Sword was passed."
